      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_75a06d1b",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: farm_equipment_and_livestock_don_t_mix; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a smiling interracial couple in a romantic embrace, juxtaposed with the text 'farm equipment and livestock don't mix.' This creates a false analogy that implies the couple is inappropriate or mismatched, potentially mocking interracial relationships. While not explicitly abusive or hateful toward a specific protected group, the meme uses a crude, degrading metaphor to suggest that interracial relationships are unnatural or unsuitable, which can be harmful by reinforcing negative stereotypes and contributing to social stigma. The intent is to provoke a reaction through humor that relies on a crude, potentially offensive comparison, which may be perceived as demeaning to the couple or to interracial relationships in general.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1676c870"
      },
