      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'farm equipment and livestock don't mix' as a crude metaphor to imply that interracial relationships are unnatural or unsuitable. This relies on the real-world stereotype that interracial unions are inappropriate or mismatched, which is a harmful and outdated notion often used to reinforce racial segregation and social stigma.",
