      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that Black people are inherently incompatible with other racial groups, which is a form of racial prejudice. This stereotype is part of a broader history of anti-Black racism that includes claims of hypersexualization, criminality, and 'otherness' that dehumanize Black individuals and reinforce systemic discrimination.",
