      "label": "Racist Metaphor",
      "description": "The phrase 'farm equipment and livestock don't mix' is a racist metaphor that equates interracial relationships with the unnatural pairing of incompatible species. This metaphor is used to demean and dehumanize interracial couples by implying they are biologically or socially unsuitable, which is a form of racialized dehumanization.",
