      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0680d459",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that may find crude, racially charged humor offensive or provocative, particularly those who are unaware of or insensitive to the harmful stereotypes it perpetuates. The target audience likely includes individuals who are familiar with or enjoy internet memes that rely on shock value, crude analogies, or social commentary that may be offensive to marginalized groups. The meme’s intent to provoke a reaction through a degrading metaphor suggests it is aimed at viewers who are comfortable with or indifferent to racialized humor and social stigma.",
